sequenceDiagram
 actor P as Patient
 participant UI as Web frontend
 participant A as AuthService
 participant S as AppointmentService
 participant R as AppointmentRepository
 P->>UI: Select slot and confirm
 UI->>A: requireRole(token, patient)
 A-->>UI: authenticated patientId
 UI->>S: book(patientId, slotId)
 S->>R: begin()
 S->>R: lockSlot(slotId)
 R-->>S: slot and current status
 alt Future slot open and provider active
  S->>R: insertConfirmed(patientId, slotId)
  Note over S,R: Unique active-slot constraint
  S->>R: commit()
  S-->>UI: confirmed appointment
  UI-->>P: Show booking details
 else Slot unavailable or constraint conflict
  S->>R: rollback()
  S-->>UI: booking conflict
  UI-->>P: Choose another time
 end
